@startuml Google Authentication Sequence
!define LIGHTBLUE #E3F2FD
!define LIGHTGREEN #E8F5E8
!define LIGHTYELLOW #FFF9C4
!define LIGHTRED #FFEBEE

title Google Client-Side Authentication Flow

actor User as U
participant "WalletModal\n(React)" as WM LIGHTBLUE
participant "Google Sign-In\nLibrary" as GAPI LIGHTYELLOW
participant "Google OAuth\nServers" as GOAuth LIGHTGREEN
participant "App State\n(React)" as AppState LIGHTBLUE

== Initialization ==
U -> WM: Click "Connect with Google"
activate WM
WM -> WM: setState('connecting')
WM -> GAPI: gapi.auth2.getAuthInstance()
activate GAPI
GAPI -> GAPI: Check if initialized
alt Not initialized
  GAPI -> GOAuth: Load Google Sign-In
  activate GOAuth
  GOAuth -> GAPI: Return auth instance
  deactivate GOAuth
end

== Authentication Flow ==
WM -> GAPI: auth2.signIn()
GAPI -> GOAuth: Open Google Sign-In popup
activate GOAuth
GOAuth -> U: Show Google login form
U -> GOAuth: Enter credentials / consent
GOAuth -> GAPI: Return GoogleUser object
deactivate GOAuth
GAPI -> WM: GoogleUser with profile + token
deactivate GAPI

== Data Extraction ==
WM -> WM: Extract user data:\n- profile.getEmail()\n- profile.getName()\n- profile.getImageUrl()\n- getAuthResponse().id_token

== Success Handling ==
WM -> WM: setState('connected')
WM -> AppState: onAuthSuccess(userData)
activate AppState
AppState -> AppState: setUser(userData)
AppState -> WM: Close modal
deactivate AppState
WM -> U: Authentication success
deactivate WM

== Error Handling ==
alt Authentication Error
  GAPI -> WM: Error (popup blocked, user denied, etc.)
  activate WM
  WM -> WM: setState('error')
  WM -> WM: setError(errorMessage)
  WM -> U: Show error message
  deactivate WM
end

== Logout Flow ==
U -> AppState: Click logout
activate AppState
AppState -> GAPI: auth2.signOut()
activate GAPI
GAPI -> GOAuth: Revoke session
activate GOAuth
GOAuth -> GAPI: Confirmation
deactivate GOAuth
GAPI -> AppState: Sign out complete
deactivate GAPI
AppState -> AppState: setUser(null)
AppState -> U: Logged out
deactivate AppState

note over WM, AppState
  **Key Benefits:**
  • No page redirects
  • Modal stays open
  • Client-side only
  • Compatible with dePick
end note

note over GAPI, GOAuth
  **Environment:**
  • VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
  • Authorized Origin: localhost:5173
  • No callback URLs needed
end note

@enduml